<title>SOUTH AFRICA: SAMRAND CAUTIONS IT IN TALKS.</title>
<headline>SAMRAND CAUTIONS IT IN TALKS.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-12-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Samrand Development Holdings Ltd said on Thursday it was involved in negotiations which, if successfully concluded, could affect its share price.</p>
<p>It advised shareholders to exercise caution in their share dealings.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom 27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
